@@How this problem works



@@FP


@@ABELIAN

\ni The given group is decomposed into a direct product of
cyclic groups. The generators of the finite cyclic groups
are a set of generators of its torsion subgroup.

\ni For a discussion of general finitely generated abelian groups,
see @General_abelian_groups@General_abelian_groups::General discussion@

@@NILPOTENT

