@@FP



@@ABELIAN

@@NILPOTENT

Given an element in a nilpotent group, we compute a presentation for
the subgroup generated by the given element. This immediately gives
us the order of that element.

\ni For a general discussion of finitely generated nilpotent groups, see
@Nilpotent_groups@Nilpotent_groups::
General discussion@

@@FREE

