## Contents: Code supporting global settings of widget configurations.
##
## Principal Author: Roger Needham, Dmitry Bormotov
##
## Status: In progress.
##
## Revision History:
##
## 03/96 Dmitry B. made porting to tcl7.4/tk4.0
